<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche starts higher on sales gain.</title>
<headline>Roche starts higher on sales gain.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding shares were up 120 Swiss francs to 14,405 in early trading after the company reported first-half sales rose 20 percent to 9.3 billion.</p>
<p>Shares opened at 14,425 and hit a high of 14,435 before easing back.</p>
<p>&quot;When you think that 1997 is a year of product changeover, the progress from the first quarter is seen as very good. We expect Roche to rise in the short term,&quot; Zurich Cantonal Bank wrote in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
